# aginx unit env (N4 切净版). Read via env_file by the aginx-server and
# aginx-voice units; secrets belong on the device only, never in this
# file — the real /etc/aginx/env (with AGINXBRAIN_API_KEY) rides the
# aginx-update state tar from the running device, not the bake. HOME is the
# avatar home (D5: workspaces folder + runtime engine state under it).
# If a unit needs more vars later, add them here or put them in the
# sidecar store (/usr/bin/aginx-secret) and read them over the socket.
HOME=/home
